{"id":"u-423f6234-a673-4ec7-978f-cc6729fce9e5","src":"community","title":"SUPERMAN WORKOUT PLAN by Renaissance Periodization","author":"The Brofessor","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/leLsZJ-superman-workout-plan-by-renaissance-periodization","desc":"The purpose of your program is to develop a balanced, aesthetic, and powerful physique with an emphasis on creating the classic \"Superman\" V-taper look. This involves focusing on:\n\nUpper Pecs – to build a fuller, more elevated chest appearance.\n\nSide Delts – to widen the shoulders and enhance the shoulder-to-waist ratio.\n\nLats – to expand the back width, contributing to a broader upper body and narrow waist illusion.\n\n• Start at about 3 RIR for all lifts\n• For Day 2 and 4: Stick to the 2 sets and add either a rep or 5lbs to each lift in most weeks of training \n• For Day 1,3 and 5: Add 5lbs or 1 rep every week that you can\n   Add a set to an exercise if it wasn't super challenging last time, and if the target muscle wasn't sore or tired in the next session.","level":["Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":12,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-04-06T00:09:21.225Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Chest - Delts - Back","Legs - Arms","Back - Chest - Delts","Arms - Legs","Delts - Back - Chest"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Chest Fly (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Super- ROM Lateral Raise","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Upright Row (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":10,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Good Morning","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Skull Crusher (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"